    "description": "Mains powered, Class III, scanner/scale, non-automatic weighing instrument designed for flush-mounting in checkout surface. Steel framework supporting a barcode scanner, electronics, and a Flintec PBNS-30 scale module containing four loadcells. Interface for POS connection. NCR 7874-5000 has a smaller load receptor than the 7878-2000, can be mounted into an optional stainless steel mounting bracket and has a 2.5 cm longer extended weigh plate; the optional stainless steel weigh plate of the 7874-5XXX series comprises two separate sheets covering the weighing platform. The X's in the model numbers 7878-2XXX and 7874-5XXX represent numeric variables not affecting the metrological characteristics of the instrument."
